":"Is that the Thieves of Justice's Level-1 classified document...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_73","text":"Indeed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_74","text":"This is your official membership document.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_75","text":"I admit, I was a bit surprised when you sent a shuriken flying at it...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_76","text":"but since it was done to save a comrade,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_77","text":"I daresay it's made this document all the more precious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_78","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_78","text":"... I guess that's one way of interpreting it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_79","text":"Ahem! In that case, we shall hold the appointment ceremony here and now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_80","text":"That will not be necessary, Phantom.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_81","text":"Delta, I hereby appoint you as an official mem—eh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_82","text":"Wh-what did you just say?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_83","text":"I said that will not be necessary.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_84","text":"I appreciate the sentiment... but I am not yet qualified.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_85","text":"May I ask why you think that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_86","text":"When I first encountered the Commander in disguise,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_87","text":"I did not recognize him immediately.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_88","text":"For someone who cannot identify their comrades at a glance, how can they be considered an official member?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_89","text":"It's absurd.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_90","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_90","text":"Delta...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_delta_ninjathief_05_91","text":"I